---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import underConstruction from "../images/under-construction.webp";
import CodecademyCerts from "../components/CodecademyCerts.astro";
---

<MainLayout>
  <section class='projects-section'>
    <h1>Projects Page</h1>

    <div class='projects-hero-wrapper'>
      <div class='text-wrapper'>
        <p>
          I put together the Nascar page first, which is still missing the
          golden content... I have over an hour and a half of All-Star Race
          footage I shot while I was on pitroad all weekend. I still need to
          edit a video from it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Next I pumped the music page up a bit with content, I do still have
          some gems to add as time permits, and I am going to try to continue to
          keep the music haul posts up to date.
        </p>
        <p>
          Now it's time for this page. I am planning some demo videos and links
          for some things that I have built. I am also thinking of having a
          photo gallery for all the versions of my characters.
        </p>
        <p>
          The first project I want to demo for you is The Majewski Collection
          App. It's a desktop app I made with Electron that I use to manage my
          database for my music collection's catalog. I am almost done with the
          video's intro and will post that as kind of a trailer soon.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Image
        src={underConstruction}
        alt='a decorative image'
      />
    </div>
    <!-- <CodecademyCerts /> -->
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .projects-section {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: 1rem;

    .projects-hero-wrapper {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 60ch), 1fr));
      align-items: start;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-block: 3rem;
      justify-items: center;

      .text-wrapper p:not(:last-child) {
        margin-block-end: 1lh;
      }

      .text-wrapper p {
        max-width: 60ch;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        margin-block: 1.5rem;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
